      "en": "These are the words that the LORD spoke concerning Israel and concerning Judah.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 이스라엘과 유다에 대하여 하신 말씀이 이러하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "e7299b9b8d672e4b6939fd3eb495d7cda4c868419f66baa8ee69bdef48136077",
      "translation_text_hash": "09481a5c45c3e11e2ccbc41bccaf091a7dc1a9e6d083d6d60c3b237c064fea0a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
