      ],
      "en": "There is no one to plead your cause, that you may be bound up. You have no healing medicines.",
      "ko": "네 송사를 변호할 자가 없고 네 상처를 싸맬 약이 없도다",
      "source_text_hash": "519e02486bc5cb705a07bbe0482e9753bfdf11fdfe85977c18c5326814e497dd",
      "translation_text_hash": "462ccf132cdab627b6bdc2783d9c9d0aa1c2684b90919f6139f6ab577e46e77c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "네 송사를 변호할 자가 없고 네 상처를 싸맬 약이 없도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "462ccf132cdab627b6bdc2783d9c9d0aa1c2684b90919f6139f6ab577e46e77c"
      ]
    },
