      "en": "For I will restore health to you, and I will heal you of your wounds,” says the LORD, “because they have called you an outcast, saying, ‘It is Zion, whom no man seeks after.’”",
      "ko": "나 여호와가 말하노라 그들이 쫓겨난 자라 하며 찾는 자가 없는 시온이라 한즉 내가 너를 치료하여 네 상처를 낫게 하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "137cec56f2fdeaf9bc330d96685aadcb790e333cd9c00794066d1562bcaa4b27",
      "translation_text_hash": "11fa1d47a9cf4c33f016a3ccae36d2574c44af11401e025efeccbcecfc230fd7",
