      "en": "Their children also will be as before, and their congregation will be established before me. I will punish all who oppress them.",
      "ko": "그 자손은 여전하겠고 그 회중은 내 앞에 굳게 설 것이며 무릇 그를 압박하는 자는 내가 다 벌하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "2d2ede7dc627d8c183becedbb1bc28eab9e1ecd95b938c2157fb98462ac3e15e",
      "translation_text_hash": "0e80120765188cde38627f1a19bc623795b4fbb0e581e26cc1bcc979f6760447",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
