      "en": "“You shall be my people, and I will be your God.",
      "ko": "너희는 내 백성이 되겠고 나는 너희 하나님이 되리라",
      "source_text_hash": "90b790967ded44dec7e69c0e28a1e490f6a6bf5d83cd9cf72483de6fa4e2a14c",
      "translation_text_hash": "320df0f41fb50025f04887e21b05682b420a1495cbbce1bfce69869fe6066acf",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
