      "en": "Behold, the LORD’s storm, his wrath, has gone out, a sweeping storm; it will burst on the head of the wicked.",
      "ko": "보라 여호와의 노가 발하여 폭풍과 회리바람처럼 악인의 머리를 칠 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "f4ef683adda1eaa411c6087f85d4479589725088a6a02d1924dd7022bca1a99e",
      "translation_text_hash": "fbdf49f846dd997a0890f8906a950fff383431683b587bab97fe481d40e2b634",
